      "message": "chore(tests): fix analyzer print statement issues with debugPrint (#4821)\n\n* chore(tests): fix analyzer print statement issues with debugPrint\n\n* fix(tools): revert standalone CLI scripts to print to keep dart run working\n\ndebugPrint from package:flutter/foundation pulls in dart:ui transitively,\nwhich is unavailable under the bare Dart VM, breaking 'dart run' for these\nstandalone tools. It also buffers output, risking loss of the error+stack\nbefore exit(1). Use print + file-level avoid_print ignore instead, and\nre-add dart:typed_data for Uint8List in test_upload.dart.",
