      "message": "fix(video-recorder): prevent clearing video publish state when returning from editor (#4829)\n\n* fix(video-recorder): prevent clearing video publish state when returning from editor\n\n* fix(video-recorder): add autosave functionality to video editor tests\n\n* fix(video-editor): remove autosave state from VideoEditorProviderState in tests\n\n* fix(video-recorder): keep editor state when opening camera from editor\n\nLibrary/draft-resume opens the editor without mounting the recorder, so a previously persisted classic/upload recorder mode survives. Opening the in-editor camera dispatched VideoRecorderInitializeRequested without a fromEditor flag, triggering a mode-restore that called reset()/clearAll() and wiped the in-memory editor title/description/clips.\n\nThread fromEditor from screen -> event -> bloc and skip the mode-restore when opened from the editor. Adds mutation-sensitive tests for both paths.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "52902a072498cc5759f6fceac9f34cee71125d3c",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/divinevideo/divine-mobile/git/trees/52902a072498cc5759f6fceac9f34cee71125d3c"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/divinevideo/divine-mobile/git/commits/a8ca3999d7d0addd27a59d9c1fbf9f12866d2293",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqGspXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtFcQABVK1a9fiSYJMIPeZy7OyeKX\nMAibl/ct3MwGulRC+ustX1InkH6Okhs/13RRruhl2ZLvRFsNVaStNGIHkDFDkdWp\nX/Upuux3Py/CCsldPHqtAcq7qrC6qjdUR27PHnhSxYMMTjmShtcjheA0Eqovq9v3\nD0VRUYG/eBwPcsHxycG7RNYIoDpV1T1dpvq9chKI2MhNuyJRdhVCBBbT/REyAOT1\npNY7FliJdA1Qwkq+6uTAxacY5+WxocMOYIh1uHJM89IVHazNAXuvN1+d41wq9aX0\nXkQPwyN66U8D9CPG+RqX3/PotOCOfKziqyhjySXZN5fGgAmBQC7NPG3yuDInoGz9\nspa8qILcsT3lG0PsR9h9epyVqAJrbqRUT2UR/Mu2Yr0fFdTVZOpd9TnOcLNLHbXT\nA9bUWqPB+FJ7h6S2ZwrOKQxx5AytiOmLvFlsHNla41F8H8+S9qZ5IsVHGWRm8AeU\navtOB7chRlndxsTfI6kqEy9re1gGZHJC3xKzJ1MZn1bJJeHz93VN5zfMKmWI11g1\nB/0w6EsHv5DgztKJICA6gI4hLLzTEGQqhJvA+Pmenb1+TMq4+bRDUhNi7RK9Keo+\nMEvkC/PxcR6/nTIFJ0mfaqdczubN6TJj/7+7XVWJER142Ck7eKBFM37cXaM4K/rI\nm8Fc+Tl2Tu8m+HguZiPw\n=kUZP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree 52902a072498cc5759f6fceac9f34cee71125d3c\nparent 54d124ae390b99c0f9ccd0b8d5ac28b6a9dd9522\nauthor Alex Frei <40503456+hm21@users.noreply.github.com> 1780140631 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780140631 +0700\n\nfix(video-recorder): prevent clearing video publish state when returning from editor (#4829)\n\n* fix(video-recorder): prevent clearing video publish state when returning from editor\n\n* fix(video-recorder): add autosave functionality to video editor tests\n\n* fix(video-editor): remove autosave state from VideoEditorProviderState in tests\n\n* fix(video-recorder): keep editor state when opening camera from editor\n\nLibrary/draft-resume opens the editor without mounting the recorder, so a previously persisted classic/upload recorder mode survives. Opening the in-editor camera dispatched VideoRecorderInitializeRequested without a fromEditor flag, triggering a mode-restore that called reset()/clearAll() and wiped the in-memory editor title/description/clips.\n\nThread fromEditor from screen -> event -> bloc and skip the mode-restore when opened from the editor. Adds mutation-sensitive tests for both paths.",
